      "message": "I\u0027d be up for raising the limit to 100 or 120 characters, but not eliminating it.\n\nThere are two reasons for the line length limit:\n\n1. It makes diffs easier to read, which makes reviews in gerrit or seeing history in git easier.\n\n2. It makes the documentation easier to read when reading in a terminal window.",
