      "writtenOn": "2018-05-16T00:43:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Isn\u0027t this usually a bug?  From a HTML standpoint, skipping header levels is usually abusing a semantic tool for visual purposes, which goes against accessibility guidelines: https://www.w3.org/WAI/tutorials/page-structure/headings/#heading-ranks",
