      "writtenOn": "2018-05-16T00:59:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Again it\u0027s formally right, the question is: do we prefer to have a website that adhere to the W3C standard or we prefer not to lose possible contributions? I\u0027d vote for the second\n\nFun fact: no website actually pass the W3C validation rules, for example this page https://www.w3.org/WAI/tutorials/page-structure/headings/#heading-ranks has as 12 warning and 7 errors, so I wouldn\u0027t be too concerned with them",
